===Tell Regin the bad news{{subst:void|<!--301120203-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=daily|location=Hotel Lobby|update|The Civilian Scientist Regin hopes to submit his thesis on the big universe time tunnel to the Supreme Guardian.<br />However, the Ministry of Education officer tries to interrupt the submission process by demanding you to pass a quiz.<br />The question is so difficult that even someone as clever as you chose the wrong answer. Since it has come to this, tell Regin the bad news.}}
