;(Talk to Regin)
:'''Regin:''' Oh yes... that's right. And what of it? Has the paper been submitted yet?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sorry...
::'''Regin:''' Tsk, I already made it through their first two hoops, only to fall at the final hurdle like this. That's alright, and it's not your fault. Those bureaucrats have so little respect for the sciences.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This is harder than I thought...
::'''Regin:''' Now you know how frustrating things usually are for me!
:'''Regin:''' But that's alright. Misery loves company. As a scientist, I've had to swallow many a bitter pill over the years. I'm guessing you're the same?
:'''Regin:''' What is it? They asked you a difficult question, right? C'mon, spill it. Maybe I can help you get to the bottom of it...
:<!--1-second delay-->
----
;(Return to previous option selection)
:'''Regin:''' ...No, you got that one wrong? But it's so blindingly obvious!
:'''Regin:''' Ah, forget about it. I ain't mad at you. I should have no illusions about the limited intellect of "non-scientists"...
:'''Regin:''' The answer for this question is "fourteen." It hasn't been long since you left, so that guy can't have gotten too far...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Please explain how you arrived at your solution...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How can I become as clever as you?
